msgid "802.11k supplies neighbor information; 802.11v suggests transitions; 802.11r accelerates authentication. Clients decide when to roam. Steering requires usteer and must not run alongside DAWN."
msgstr "802.11k 提供邻居信息，802.11v 建议切换接入点，802.11r 加快重新认证。最终由终端决定何时漫游。启用漫游引导需要 usteer，不能与 DAWN 同时运行。"

msgid "802.11s backhaul identifier, separate from the client SSID. All managed backhaul radios must use the same identifier."
msgstr "802.11s 回程网络标识，与终端连接的 SSID 不同。所有受管回程射频必须使用相同标识。"

msgid "802.11s wireless"
msgstr "802.11s 无线回程"

msgid "A display name for this device; it does not change its cryptographic identity."
msgstr "本设备的显示名称，不会改变设备的加密身份。"

msgid "A display name only. Each network has one controller identity; matching names do not authorize a device."
msgstr "仅用于显示。每个网络只有一个控制器身份；名称相同不代表设备已获得授权。"

msgid "A local override, not synchronized to other nodes. Choose an unused address outside the upstream DHCP pool."
msgstr "这是本机覆盖配置，不会同步给其他节点。请选择未被使用、且不在上级 DHCP 地址池内的地址。"

msgid "A shared fixed channel for the selected backhaul band. Regulatory limits and DFS waiting periods still apply."
msgstr "选定回程频段使用的统一固定信道，仍需遵守所在国家的法规和 DFS 等待时间。"

msgid "AP nodes obtain management addresses from the existing gateway by default."
msgstr "AP 节点默认从现有网关获取管理地址。"

