msgstr "自动发现暂不可用，正在重试。"

msgid "Wireless capabilities are unavailable; changes will be preflighted."
msgstr "无线能力暂不可用，保存时会重新预检。"

msgid "Checking wireless capabilities; changes will be preflighted."
msgstr "正在检测无线能力，保存时会重新预检。"

msgid "Could not verify"
msgstr "未能验证"

msgid "Mesh restoration could not be verified. Check the actual network and change records; external configuration was preserved."
msgstr "无法验证 Mesh 恢复结果。请检查实际网络和变更记录；外部配置已保留。"

msgid "Settings changed during first configuration. Existing values and joining credentials were preserved. Check node changes before retrying."
msgstr "首次配置期间设置发生变化，已保留现有值和入网凭据。请查看节点变更后再重试。"

msgid "First configuration requires recovery or review. Mesh will not restart the temporary connection automatically. Check change records."
msgstr "首次配置需要恢复或检查，不会自动重新建立临时连接。请查看变更记录。"

msgid "Waiting for Root to confirm the first configuration over the managed connection. Joining credentials are retained; retrying automatically."
msgstr "等待主节点通过受管连接确认首次配置，已保留入网凭据，将自动重试。"

msgid "Waiting for managed connection confirmation"
msgstr "等待受管连接确认"

msgid "Configuration rolled back; retrying after 30 seconds"
msgstr "配置已回滚，等待 30 秒后重试"

msgid "Configuration rolled back; waiting for the controller connection before retrying"
msgstr "配置已回滚，等待连接控制器后重试"

msgid "Recovery conflict; inspect node changes before retrying"
msgstr "回滚存在冲突，请先检查节点变更"

msgid "Health confirmation timed out; the previous configuration was restored. Inspect the failed health checks."
msgstr "健康确认超时，已恢复变更前配置。请查看未通过的健康检查。"

msgid "The device rebooted before confirmation; the previous configuration was restored."
msgstr "设备在确认前重启，已恢复变更前配置。"

msgid "The installed Wi-Fi components incorrectly reject interface activation. Update or repair the firmware components before joining; extending the timeout will not help."
msgstr "当前 Wi-Fi 组件错误地拒绝启用接口。请先更新或修复固件组件再加入；延长超时不能解决此问题。"

msgid "Waiting for first configuration"
msgstr "等待首次配置"

msgid "Firmware components need repair"
msgstr "需要修复固件组件"

msgid "Configuration preflight failed; waiting for the issue to be resolved"
msgstr "配置预检未通过，等待修复后重试"

msgid "Clear records"
msgstr "清理记录"

msgid "Clearing records…"
msgstr "正在清理记录…"

msgid "Cleared %s records."
msgstr "已清理 %s 条记录。"

msgid "Records changed. Close this dialog and refresh before clearing."
msgstr "记录已发生变化。请关闭此窗口，刷新后重新确认清理。"

msgid "Clear all %s records in “%s”?"
msgstr "是否清理全部 %s 条记录（%s）？"

msgid "Only this device’s history in this group is cleared. Running operations, Mesh settings and recovery backups are preserved."
msgstr "仅清理本设备这一类历史记录。正在执行的操作、Mesh 配置和恢复备份会保留。"

msgid "No node repairs"
msgstr "暂无节点修复记录"

msgid "No Mesh operation records"
msgstr "暂无 Mesh 启停记录"

msgid "The AP will finish restoring after local LAN health checks pass. The controller result updates when contact resumes."
msgstr "本机 LAN 健康检查通过后，AP 将完成恢复；重新联系控制器后更新管理端结果。"

msgid "Controller loss recovery"
msgstr "Root 失联恢复"

msgid "Mesh was automatically disabled after losing authenticated controller contact. Connect to LAN using the restored management address to configure this device."
msgstr "持续无法与 Root 建立认证连接，已自动关闭本机 Mesh。请连接 LAN 口，用恢复后的管理地址配置设备。"

msgid "Controller contact was lost. The AP is restoring its original LAN configuration."
msgstr "无法联系 Root，AP 正在恢复接管前的 LAN 配置。"

msgid "Automatic restoration could not be verified. Check the transaction result, configuration conflicts and diagnostics."
msgstr "失联自动恢复未通过验证，请查看事务结果、配置冲突和网络诊断。"

msgid "Background services"
msgstr "后台服务"

msgid "Stopped; starts when needed"
msgstr "已停止，操作时启动"

msgid "Standby for remote management"
msgstr "待命，保留远程管理"

msgid "Recovery in progress"
msgstr "正在恢复配置"

msgid "Revocation records (%s)"
msgstr "撤销记录（%s）"

msgid "Revoked at"
msgstr "撤销时间"

msgid "Configuration restoration"
msgstr "配置恢复"

msgid "Needs verification"
msgstr "待验证"

msgid "Join Mesh"
msgstr "加入 Mesh"

msgid "Stop joining"
msgstr "停止加入"

msgid "The controller accepts Mesh routers automatically. This device applies the network configuration after health checks pass."
msgstr "主节点自动接纳 Mesh 路由器。本机将在健康检查通过后提交网络配置。"

msgid "Connect to the controller Wi-Fi. Mesh routers are accepted automatically; ordinary Wi-Fi clients remain clients."
msgstr "连接主节点 Wi-Fi 后，Mesh 路由器会自动加入；手机等普通终端仍是普通客户端。"

msgid "For wired joining, connect this router to the controller LAN. For wireless joining, enter the controller Wi-Fi name and password."
msgstr "有线加入：连接主节点的 LAN 口。无线加入：输入主节点的 Wi-Fi 名称和密码。"

msgid "Waiting for the controller to become available"
msgstr "等待主节点可用"

msgid "Registering node identity"
msgstr "正在登记节点身份"

msgid "Stopping background services"
msgstr "后台服务正在停止"

msgid "Updating background services"
msgstr "后台服务调整中"

msgid "6 GHz policy"
msgstr "6 GHz 策略"

msgid "6 GHz requires WPA3. Nodes without 6 GHz use their other selected bands when available."
msgstr "6 GHz 需要 WPA3。没有 6 GHz 的节点使用其他已选可用频段。"

msgid "Allow mutual access with LAN"
msgstr "允许与主 LAN 互访"

msgid "Allow traffic in both directions between this network and the main LAN. Other business networks remain isolated."
msgstr "允许此网络与主 LAN 双向通信。其他业务网络仍保持隔离。"

msgid "Automatic"
msgstr "自动"

msgid "Automatic radio planning"
msgstr "自动射频规划"

msgid "Business subnet"
msgstr "业务子网"

msgid "Client bands"
msgstr "客户端频段"

msgid "Client channels"
msgstr "客户端信道"

msgid "Client isolation"
msgstr "客户端隔离"

msgid "Isolate wireless clients on the same AP. Guest access to LAN is controlled separately."
msgstr "隔离同一 AP 上的无线客户端。Guest 对主 LAN 的访问由独立策略控制。"

msgid "Country code"
msgstr "国家码"

msgid "Enable network"
msgstr "启用网络"

msgid "Enable planning"
msgstr "启用规划"

msgid "Guest"
msgstr "访客"

msgid "Guest network"
msgstr "访客网络"

msgid "Internet access"
msgstr "允许上网"

msgid "Keep current"
msgstr "保留当前值"

msgid "LAN"
msgstr "主 LAN"

msgid "LAN access exceptions"
msgstr "主 LAN 访问例外"

msgid "Optional LAN-to-network service ports, for example TCP:80,443;UDP:123. Used when mutual LAN access is disabled."
msgstr "可选的主 LAN 到此网络的服务端口，例如 TCP:80,443;UDP:123。用于未开启主 LAN 互访时。"

msgid "Planning uses legal driver frequencies and passive load observations. A radio shared with wireless backhaul keeps the coordinated backhaul channel."
msgstr "规划依据驱动允许的频率和被动观测的负载。与无线回程共用的射频保留统一回程信道。"

msgid "Power ceiling (dBm)"
msgstr "功率上限（dBm）"

msgid "Require on every node"
msgstr "所有节点必须支持"

msgid "The planned power never exceeds the selected ceiling or the driver regulatory limit."
msgstr "规划功率不超过所选上限和驱动报告的监管限制。"

msgid "Transmit power"
msgstr "发射功率"

msgid "Use an independent password for this network. Leave empty to keep its existing password."
msgstr "为此网络使用独立密码。留空以保留其现有密码。"

msgid "Use auto or a private /24 subnet with gateway address .1. DHCP runs on the routing gateway."
msgstr "填写 auto 或网关地址为 .1 的私有 /24 子网。DHCP 由路由网关提供。"

msgid "Use auto to allocate a free VLAN. The control VLAN is reserved."
msgstr "填写 auto 以分配空闲 VLAN。管理控制 VLAN 为保留值。"

msgid "Use the actual country of operation. To change it, first apply with channels and power kept; then preview automatic planning after the driver refreshes."
msgstr "填写设备实际使用地区的国家码。修改时先保留信道和功率进行应用，驱动刷新后再预览自动规划。"

msgid "Use when available"
msgstr "可用时启用"

msgid "VLAN ID"
msgstr "VLAN ID"

msgid "Checking all devices"
msgstr "正在检查所有设备"

msgid "Ready for approval"
msgstr "等待批准"

msgid "Checking network health"
msgstr "正在检查网络健康"

msgid "Configuration confirmed"
msgstr "配置已确认"

msgid "Transferring controller authority"
msgstr "正在转移控制权"

msgid "Authority received"
msgstr "控制权已接收"

msgid "Activating new controller"
msgstr "正在启用新控制器"

msgid "Retiring previous controller authority"
msgstr "正在移除原控制器的控制权"

msgid "Connecting to new controller"
msgstr "正在连接新控制器"

msgid "Connected to new controller"
msgstr "已连接新控制器"

