msgstr "正在完成迁移"

msgid "Migration complete"
msgstr "迁移已完成"

msgid "Migration needs attention"
msgstr "迁移需要处理"

msgid "Migration preview is unavailable"
msgstr "迁移预览不可用"

msgid "Current controller"
msgstr "当前控制器"

msgid "New controller"
msgstr "新控制器"

msgid "Data gateway"
msgstr "数据网关"

msgid "The data gateway, Internet connection and device identities are preserved. Existing enrollment invitations are invalidated. Keep every device connected by Ethernet until migration completes."
msgstr "保留数据网关、互联网连接和设备身份。已有加入邀请将失效。迁移完成前请保持所有设备通过网线连接。"

msgid "Approve migration"
msgstr "批准迁移"

msgid "I approve moving controller authority to the displayed device"
msgstr "我批准将控制权迁移到所示设备"

msgid "Review controller migration"
msgstr "检查控制器迁移"

msgid "Open new controller"
msgstr "打开新控制器"

msgid "Review migration"
msgstr "检查迁移"

msgid "Cancel migration"
msgstr "取消迁移"

msgid "Resume migration"
msgstr "继续迁移"

msgid "Move controller management manually to a synchronized device. The data gateway stays on its current device."
msgstr "手动将控制器管理迁移到已同步的设备。数据网关仍由当前设备承担。"

msgid "Preview controller migration"
msgstr "预览控制器迁移"

msgid "Controller migration"
msgstr "控制器迁移"

msgid "Advanced"
msgstr "高级"

msgid "Native 5 GHz coexistence may exchange the primary and secondary channels within the approved block."
msgstr "原生 5 GHz 共存机制可在批准的信道块内交换主、副信道。"

msgid "Controller migration is managed by the current controller."
msgstr "请在当前控制器上管理控制器迁移。"

msgid "Choose the highest driver power candidate at or below the ceiling. If none is available, planning is refused. Actual driver power is checked before confirmation."
msgstr "选择不超过上限的最高驱动候选功率。没有可用档位时拒绝规划，确认前检查驱动实际功率。"

msgid "Fresh network inventory is required for Guest configuration"
msgstr "配置访客网络需要最新的网络地址信息。"

msgid "Allow traffic in both directions between this network and the main LAN. Guest client isolation is configured separately."
msgstr "允许此网络与主 LAN 双向互访。访客客户端隔离单独配置。"

msgid "Cancelling"
msgstr "正在取消"

msgid "Waiting"
msgstr "等待中"

msgid "Automatic channel choices use passive measurements when available, otherwise deterministic legal allocation"
msgstr "自动信道选择优先采用被动负载测量；没有测量时，按确定规则分配合法信道"

msgid "Device certificates"
msgstr "设备证书"

msgid "Certificates renew automatically within 30 days of expiry. Each device renews independently when connected."
msgstr "证书在到期前 30 天内自动续期。各设备连接后独立完成，不互相等待。"

msgid "Renew certificates now"
msgstr "立即续期证书"

msgid "Certificate renewal requested. Connected devices will renew automatically."
msgstr "已请求续期，已连接的设备将自动完成。"
